; The warg runs around the player and howls
;
; Script handler (op 3, in the warg's script #R$C92F). Always passes the test
; pass of the script engine (#R$9D44); when the player is in the warg's
; location it prints "The vicious warg run around you and howls." (#R$97F4
; adds the full stop and a new line).
; .
; Hardware: none (the text goes through the message printer).
@label=WargHowls
c$A5D1 CALL $9D44
 $A5D4 LD HL,$C452   ; the warg's location
 $A5D7 LD A,($C12B)  ; player's location
 $A5DA CP (HL)
 $A5DB RET NZ        ; elsewhere: silent
 $A5DC LD HL,$B085   ; "The vicious warg run around you and howls"
 $A5DF JP $97F4
